Subject: [PATCH] Claude: add KidsChinese rules block (collection "chinese")

KidsChinese (seanlin-larc/KidsChinese) uses this Firebase project and
the same accounts. Learners YC and JY; parents SL and CJ; Guest has no
access. Roles come from players/{uid}.code.

- firebase/firestore.rules: new KidsChinese block; existing rules unchanged.
- firebase/tests/kidschinese.rules.test.mjs: 9 tests.
- firebase/package.json: run both test files one at a time (two files
  in parallel clear the same emulator database and cancel each other).
- README: KidsChinese section and storage keys.

Emulator result: 18 of 18 passed (9 Kids Games + 9 KidsChinese), two runs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
